audio:
  lang: en
  lines:
    '|a||Reading Chekhov in Russian: Fat and Thin':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Two school friends meet at a Petersburg–Moscow railway station, until one hears the other''s rank: Chekhov''s «Толстый и тонкий», adapted, read in Russian.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:gjidfb'
    '|a||Сентя́брь. Моско́вский вокза́л. Ма́ша прие́хала на Сапса́не, с чемода́нами. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Зна́ешь, где мы? Ра́ньше э́тот вокза́л называ́лся «Никола́евский».':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:e4pk7k'
    '|a||Как в расска́зе Че́хова «То́лстый и то́нкий»!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Да! Там на вокза́ле встре́тились два прия́теля.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Where are Tom and Masha?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2080
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||На вокза́ле: at a station.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||What does the station remind Tom of?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3000
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Расска́з Че́хова: a story by Chekhov. Расска́з, from рассказа́ть.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5840
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Анто́н Па́влович Че́хов. In 1883 he wrote a very short story.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Until the 1920s this was Никола́евский вокза́л, and so was its twin in Moscow.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:17mh1tp'
    '|b||«То́лстый и то́нкий»: Fat and Thin. Tom reads the fat one, I read the thin one.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5920
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1wzgy65'
    '|a||То́лстый, то́нкий. Прия́тель: a pal, a bit less close than друг. Гимна́зия: the old grammar school.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9ihsax'
    '|b||Чин: a rank in the Tsar''s service. Ошеломлены́: stunned. And to a very high rank: ва́ше превосходи́тельство.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9440
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:ee3azp'
    '|a||Прочита́йте. Adapted from Chekhov, four pages, no stress marks now: you''re reading real Russian.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7920
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1dmdq5o'
    '|a||На вокза́ле Никола́евской желе́зной доро́ги встре́тились два прия́теля: оди́н то́лстый, друго́й то́нкий.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:c6upd0'
    '|a||То́лстый обе́дал на вокза́ле.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:u2sksj'
    '|a||То́нкий вы́шел из ваго́на с чемода́нами.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6keumr'
    '|a||Ря́дом бы́ли его́ жена́ и сын.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:vlel9e'
    '|a||«Порфи́рий! Ты ли э́то?» — сказа́л то́лстый, уви́дев то́нкого.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fq79nz'
    '|b||Да́льше.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1120
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:4tudoy'
    '|b||«Ми́ша! Друг де́тства! Отку́да ты?» — сказа́л то́нкий.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5000
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1w46zlw'
    '|a||О́ба бы́ли прия́тно ошеломлены́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1o1299e'
    '|b||«Э́то моя́ жена́, Луи́за. А э́то сын мой, Нафана́ил.»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4840
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:t3vp39'
    '|b||«В гимна́зии вме́сте учи́лись!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2240
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:b9iz99'
    '|a||Нафана́ил немно́го поду́мал и снял ша́пку.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:6toz9x'
    '|a||Да́льше.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1higk6m'
    '|a||«Как живёшь, друг? Слу́жишь где? Дослужи́лся?» — спроси́л то́лстый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5040
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1w46zlw'
    '|b||«Служу́, ми́лый мой! Чин у меня́ ма́ленький, де́нег ма́ло.»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5480
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1tpqen3'
    '|b||«А ты как?»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1240
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:14no8as'
    '|a||«Я уже́ та́йный сове́тник», — сказа́л то́лстый.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:9bqdce'
    '|a||То́нкий вдруг побледне́л. Сам он стал ма́леньким.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1n94ch7'
    '|b||«Я, ва́ше превосходи́тельство… О́чень прия́тно!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1w46zlw'
    '|a||«Для чего́ э́тот тон? Мы с тобо́й друзья́ де́тства!»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:l6c0gu'
    '|b||«Что вы…» — сказа́л то́нкий, улыба́ясь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3040
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:fo2mng'
    '|b||«Э́то, ва́ше превосходи́тельство, сын мой Нафана́ил…»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3720
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:gusiwv'
    '|a||То́лстый отверну́лся и по́дал ему́ ру́ку на проща́нье.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:miuoie'
    '|a||Все тро́е бы́ли прия́тно ошеломлены́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:oztslv'
    '|b||The fat one is sickened by it, and turns away.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3480
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:10l09g1'
    '|a||Все тро́е: the thin one, his wife, his son. The same words as at the meeting, but now it''s the rank.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:i5eljh'
    '|b||Посмотри́те: first ты, then вы, to the same old friend.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4920
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:11q13ii'
    '|a||Why does the thin one suddenly say вы?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:18ti605'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! The rank, та́йный сове́тник.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||In 105 вы was for strangers; in 124 О́льга Серге́евна came over to ты. Here an old friend switches to вы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10840
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А мы? Back on the platform. Tap Practise after the dialogue.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5800
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1qnm3fa'
    '|a||Шесть вопро́сов. Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:16solmz'
    '|a||Ма́ша! Ско́лько чемода́нов!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1pzz8co'
    '|b||Три чемода́на и две су́мки. Тепе́рь я живу́ здесь!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4120
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Дава́й я понесу́ чемода́ны.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||How many suitcases has Masha brought?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Три чемода́на: three.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||What does Tom offer?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1680
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Дава́й я понесу́: let me carry them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2800
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Да́льше. Вы́берите.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Запо́лните про́пуски.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:lxdu3a'
    '|a||Два прия́теля вме́сте учи́лись в гимна́зии.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Your school friend now has a very high rank. He says: «Мы с тобо́й друзья́ де́тства!» You say…':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7960
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:4appih'
    '|b||Пра́вильно! Friends stay on ты.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3360
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Скажи́те.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1520
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Мы с тобо́й друзья́ де́тства!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Напиши́те it with вы, as to a general: «Как ты живёшь?»':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1gfn5zy'
    '|a||Пра́вильно! Вы and the те ending.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Как вы живёте?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||6 из 6.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Друг де́тства, then ва́ше превосходи́тельство: one rank, and a friend is gone.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7400
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:162al6r'
    '|a||Сто три́дцать уро́ков.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:sjg6um'
    '|a||Now you can read Chekhov and the news, and speak to a neighbour, a boss and a friend, each the right way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7960
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:14bk4lm'
    '|b||Чита́йте, слу́шайте, говори́те по-ру́сски!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:12ckfrn'
    '|b||До встре́чи!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1320
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:1l8eu0q'
    '|a||До встре́чи!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:68p4cw'
    '|b||Расска́з Че́хова: a story by Chekhov.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4000
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||It''s the rank: та́йный сове́тник.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2960
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Дава́й я понесу́ чемода́ны: let me carry them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Friends stay on ты: the fat one says so himself.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3880
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|b||Приве́т! Как ты?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1800
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||With вы, the verb ends in те: как вы живёте?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||0 из 6.':
      mp3: 
